			<div class="content" id="post-content-4056381">
									

<p>Heyo! This is a document I've been working on for a bit, an RPG supplement for my home game, that crosses D and D with Fallout and the SCP Foundation. I figured it might be an interesting thing to have available on the site, and, if it does well, I'll add more supplements as time goes on. It's just supposed to be very basic at start, and, I'm sure, works well for project crossover. Let me know if you use it, or have idea for additional supplements!</p>
<p>(yes, there are very few 'Demons' included in this document. That's on purpose. The players have all been given access to this document, and I don't want them gettign ahead of themselves for what they're running into.)</p>

