														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4057059">
									

<p>In my opinion, Fallout as a setting primarily works under three premises:</p>
<ul>
<li>Jingoism has ruined the world, and capitalism has ruined America specifically.</li>
<li>Everything that has happened to humanity is humanity’s fault.</li>
<li>The story of Fallout is primarily concerned with survival, growth, and reconstruction.</li>
</ul>
<p>Little of this shines through in this document. I just can’t find myself buying in.</p>

							</div>

